  "description": "ASP.NET Core middleware and service for IP-based access control using the IPinfo API.\n      Features: VPN/proxy/Tor detection, geo-location lookup, country restrictions,\n      IP whitelisting, in-memory caching, and fail-open design.\n      Plug into any .NET 6/7/8 Web API with a single AddIpGuard() call.",
  "id": "ArthaTech.IpGuard",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-03-09T09:44:26.037Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
